  "result": "{\"seen_before\": true, \"matches\": [\"PowerToys#42463\", \"PowerToys#43790\", \"PowerToys#44285\"], \"answer\": \"This has been reported before. When Light Switch changes the theme while Task Manager is already open, Task Manager ends up with a mix of light and dark elements. The archive has no fix or workaround for it yet. The maintainers closed the later reports as duplicates of PowerToys#42463, so follow that ticket for updates. One related report (PowerToys#44259) says restarting the taskbar fixed a similar mixed theme. Closing and reopening Task Manager after a theme switch should also give it the correct colors, though no past ticket confirms that.\"}",
